Bind Npc 24432 Zone 1
Quest 421 "[Repeatable Solo] Scolar Hunt"
    Repeat always
    Journal "[Guard] Keife has commissioned you to hunt Scolar. However, it will not count when you are in a party."
    Kill 10 of 1250, 1200 at direction_540

Requires player level >= 45 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 1000000 experience or 1400000 with premium

direction_540 = location "Scolar" about "Scolar\nMagic organism created by Pathos`s casting curse on scarecrow unlike golems, Scolar do not possess conscience; showers curse attacks at all humans who approach it" found "Karus" at 506 517 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, there's a message from [Sentinel] Cape."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "I have yet another favor to ask you. Monsters named Scolars dwell in our village outskirts. It's a magic organism Pathos spurned out of casting a curse on scarecrows. They attack all humans who approach them with curse magic."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I know it's no easy task but I don't have anyone else to ask. Please help us."

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. Peace has been restored to the village once again. This is all I can give you now in compensation but I promise to reward you handsomely next time."
